REPRODUCTION OF BARANGAY RECORDS, DATA AND SIMILAR DOCUMENTS

REQUIREMENTS:
    A. Request letter for securing Barangay records, data or smilar documents 

STEPS ON HOW TO GET REPRODUCTION OF BARANGAY RECORDS, DATA AND SIMILAR DOCUMENTS 

    1. Go to Barangay hall with the request for securing Barangay records, data or similar document and log in on the record book 
       with the purpose to the Officer of the Day. 
    
    2. Present request to OIC/Barangay Secretary on the Barangay record, data and documents needed for verification.

    3. Pay the cost of the reproduction of the documents and Barangay records before releasing.


